libftd3xx-ffi (SERMA Safety & Security fork)
=============================================

This project is a fork of github.com/ftdi-rs/libftd3xx-ffi, originally
authored by the ftdi-rs maintainers under the MIT/0BSD dual license.
Modifications by SERMA Safety & Security (2024-2026).

The non-vendor source code in this repository is dual-licensed MIT/0BSD
at your option, in keeping with the upstream license. See LICENSE for
the full text of both license options.

FTDI D3XX driver redistribution
-------------------------------

The FTDI D3XX driver libraries vendored under vendor/ are redistributed
in unmodified form per the FTDI Driver Licence Terms:

  https://ftdichip.com/driver-licence-terms-details/

The vendor/ directory contains FTDI's proprietary driver headers, sample
code, and binary libraries (static + dynamic) for Linux x86_64 and
Windows (x86 + x86_64).

Downstream products that ship a binary statically linked against this
crate must include the FTDI license notice in their product's about/
legal screen or accompanying documentation, in keeping with the FTDI
Driver Licence Terms.

